IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0016.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY SHP0016C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 SHIP-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM WEIGHT-PRICING
    DISPLAY "SHIP-CHARGE=" SHIP-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
WEIGHT-PRICING.
    IF CU-PKG-WEIGHT NOT > 2
        MOVE 5 TO SHIP-CHARGE
    ELSE
        IF CU-PKG-WEIGHT NOT GREATER THAN 10
            MOVE 12 TO SHIP-CHARGE
        ELSE
            COMPUTE SHIP-CHARGE = CU-PKG-WEIGHT * 1.25
        END-IF
    END-IF.
